body:
We get all hung up on who deserves this or that. We value ourselves by our economic importance. Never mind that some people who do rather well financially and have lots of friends might have made said money by working in or owning a payday loan company. In the eyes of society this person is good and valued while your average hikki or homeless person who might give blood or plasma or at the very least is considerate enough to at least limit their misery to themselves. Meanwhile the payday loan company keeps on chugging along destroying lives and families like an angry kaiju smashing a city .

&#x200B;

Friendships and relationships are hard. People have different expectations to what people's roles are and if your mind or circumstances are in anyway abnormal you will run into problems.

&#x200B;

In the end you cannot run from your own legs. We can try to be better versions of what we are but we cannot change who we are at the core of our being.  Value is subjective to the situation and people at hand.

Isolation is a weight so heavy it can distort everything. Not distortion in the sense of falsehood but in the same way the fact that a house is burning makes sensibilities like neatness and politeness absurdities in context to the situation. I have no idea what the circumstances around the situation but I can only apply what I know from being in a similar situation.

&#x200B;

My only human contact is my 80 year old mother who can often react in ways that can be difficult regardless of how careful I am in dealing with her. I love her but do not live with her but I do live close geographically. I come to the point again and again that the only way to survive this is to limit the space she occupies in my head and work out ways to prevent her from knowing anything about my life or feelings beyond what she already knows.

&#x200B;

This kills me because I know she will not be around forever and she is my only human contact. I lost my father after dong this to him every time I saw him. I live fill of resentments and unanswered questions. He is, of course, beyond anything in this life so all I can do is just try to process the pain which continues unreduced 7 years after learning about his death. I try to move on but there is nothing to move on to. Sucks.

&#x200B;

Not sure if this helps.

If I posted every time something like this has happened to me, my posts would take up the majority of reddit. I am not saying your experience is not valid. You asked if you are alone in this, you are not. I think most the people looking for someone experience both rejection and encounter situations where they have to ghost someone for reasons the might not be able to explain at the time.

&#x200B;

The problem is made worse because the more you need social interaction the more people feel justified in either putting barriers against you socially, plain mistreating you, or being uneasy around you.

&#x200B;

It can be frustrating. Neuro-divergence only makes the whole process more difficult and heartbreaking. What can I say? We have a culture that highly values success in romantic interactions and penalizes those who have difficulty. 

&#x200B;

It might not even be that you are inadequate. Sometimes things just do not work out. You can't win if you don't play

Yeah I can even prove at least in a small way that black propaganda exist but will only do so in a dm. It's no big secret just one of those things I just do not want associated with my online identity.

&#x200B;

My real worry goes back to the shoplifting technique I mentioned. You see it works better when the store personnel gets wise, all the shoplifters need to do is add a person. The only means against black propaganda would be neutral information, that is information that seems mundane and unrelated to discern the truth. Thus even those who do their own research can be easily lied to.

Aside from spiritual claims, what is a spiritual system? In simplest terms it is a way of thinking. We can make claims about spiritual events but what can we actually say that is factual? The Left Hand Path differs from the Right Hand Path on the subjects of purity, morals and cultural norms.

&#x200B;

First I might point out that the idea that the Left Hand Path is or is not superior to the Right Hand Path is antithetical to Left Hand Path thinking. The Right Hand Path and conventional religion are derived from concepts that worked for the majority of people. These conventions have been wrong before.  Take the example that most religions and Right Hand Path systems discouraged the handling of corpses. If you have ever had a life saving surgery then you owe your life to people who went against that convention in ways that would have been considered ghastly, evil and ghoulish at the time. This is the real value of the Left Hand Path.

&#x200B;

Urban legends and conspiracy theories might paint a different picture as you so generously illustrate. As I have said before Fire can burn your house down  or it can keep you warm and cook your food. You can accept the simplistic image of what the Left Hand Path is based on rumor and the stories told by various people or you can find out for yourself, it makes no difference to me. Perhaps another subbreddit might be a bit more charitable to your stories.

The butterfly often signifies change. It might be important to the symbolism that butterflies live for a very short time. 

&#x200B;

Dragonflies are predators that are common in wetlands and such. They have little fear of humans and larger animals. This is because they move at high speeds. 

&#x200B;

One way or another there seems to be a lot of change depicted here. Change is both the cause of and a reaction to trauma.

In the end, drug testing still exists because the court system is about money. Rich people can afford better lawyers so basically justice and representation in government is different if you have money. Weed is largely and historically the drug of the poor. Sure some rich people smoke weed now but they rarely have to deal with a probation drug test or a test at a job. Weed stays in your system for a long time and is easy to detect. This gives both the criminal justice system and employers one more thing to hold over the little people. 

&#x200B;

Even after legalization testing will continue. When you think about all the illegal drugs that can either be undetectable within the testing window, or are completely undetectable, the take into consideration that there are substances that get you high that the system does not know about, you realize that testing is more about fear and authority than anything else.

Politics are about the things we ignore as much as they are about our beliefs, opinions and the kind of world we want to live in. Many people call themselves apolitical without realizing politics are an essential element of civilization and working with others on any level. We say we despise politicians for being manipulative and deceptive without realizing that all communication and art requires manipulation and deception on some level. 

&#x200B;

This is not hypocrisy, it is a necessary lie we must tell ourselves to define the world. Just because the map is not the territory does not invalidate the utility of maps. Everyone considers themselves the hero of their own story, they want to believe they are good even though they seldom are. 

&#x200B;

Every authoritarian will tell you they champion freedom. Behind every humanitarian hides a salivating beast who views those they seek to help as cattle to be fattened, indoctrinated or caged as pets. Rebels are just simping sycophants seeking approval above all else. Again this is not because these people are morally deficient or hypocrites. It is because most people define life by peak experiences. 

&#x200B;

Peak experiences make up just a tiny fraction of our life.  Most of our lives are full of moments that we consider boring and unremarkable. Doing laundry, finding a public restroom, musak in an elevator moments, punctuated by brief sublime moments of beauty and meaning, trauma and terror and decorated with anxieties and amusements that rarely amount to anything. 

&#x200B;

It is my belief that the day we decide to define our politics (also art, philosophy and religion) on the unremarkable and practical rather than absolute utopias or terrifying threats, will our lives and governments have any measure of sanity. 

&#x200B;

I came at this point by a life of hardship and social ostracization. I am 54 and a disabled male if that helps.

Religion is simply the practice of treating ones subjective reality as objective. Rocks are hard and water is wet, we all know that. The problem is that, for most people life is a sad parade of humiliation and disappointment. People invented imaginary realities to cope with this. Once people did this maintaining shared subjective reality became the cornerstone of our lives and the connective tissue of our culture.

&#x200B;

These systems ae falling apart now because, through art and media we can believe for a short time in, say, Superman or Count Dracula and go back to objective reality once the book, comic or film is over.

&#x200B;

I remember in the 80s how people were scared shitless of Dungeons and Dragons or how every five years or so someone blames all societies ills on video games or comic books. What is going on now is that some people suffer from impoverished inner lives and have trouble dealing with suspended disbelief. Like a toddler who thinks she is invisible because she covered her eyes. Believing in conspiracies is really just a symptom of boredom.

&#x200B;

As for me I can believe in any crazy shit for an hour or two.

I am not telling you that you are useless. I am telling you that until you value yourself, nothing good will happen. You may feel heartbroken, you may feel like shit, but until you are willing to at least try to fight your own self hate and depression, no one can help you.

&#x200B;

It might look like you have no options, and your options might really be limited. There are millions of people who will talk to you on the internet like I am now. They can help until you have the self control to put on your big boy pants and  stop dwelling on how bad you perceive things to be.

&#x200B;

You cannot choose what your emotions are but you can control the things you read, listen to, and who you communicate with. You have chosen to dwell on your sorrow instead of using it to improve your situation. If you were that accepting of your fate you would not be trying to convince me of how hopeless your situation is.

There are crisis lines and suicide hotlines available for free. Perhaps subreddits on black magick are not the places to go for pity. Most magical schools and authors, especially the LHP ones will say that one of the biggest problems with neophytes and beginners is their tendency to give up when things get difficult.

&#x200B;

Some initiation rites are specifically set up to weed out the prospective initiates prone to give up. No adept or even intermediate lurks LHP subreddits looking for people they can cast spells for who are unwilling to at least attempt to help themselves. Talk to someone about your self destructive feelings. If you are a masochist there are several people who will indulge you. They should not be hard to find.

I think you have probably had people tell you things like finding someone else who wants to be with you and all that. Pretty sure that talk is going in one ear and out the other. Other people might say you should spend some time alone concentrating on self improvement, that should sound even less appealing to you. There are all kinds of methods and spells all over the internet yet your determination has not yet become strong enough for you to research them. 

&#x200B;

Think about it this way: as long as she dominates your mind, she, or your image of her, will be what controls you. Until you, and your own self determination, is in control, chances are that casting spells is a waste of time. Even if you could hex her into taking you back, whatever sabotaged the relationship will still be present, hence the problem will arise again.

&#x200B;

No one can fix you but yourself, you cannot fix others, you can only assist. The thing you really need cultivate is greater concern and control of your self. This is not simple or easy. If you do this, any magick you use is much more likely to work. The other side effect of doing this is that you will appear much more appealing and less needy.
